🔐 Password Complexity Checker (Live GUI Tool)
A real-time Password Strength Checker built with Python and Tkinter. This interactive desktop application evaluates the complexity of passwords as the user types, providing instant feedback on their strength (Weak, Medium, or Strong).

✨ Features
⌨️ Live feedback as you type your password

✅ Checks for:

Minimum length (8 characters)

Uppercase letters

Lowercase letters

Digits

Special characters

🎨 Changes background and text color based on strength

💻 Lightweight and responsive GUI

🧪 Strength Criteria
Requirement	Mandatory?
At least 8 characters	✅ Yes
At least one uppercase letter	✅ Yes
At least one lowercase letter	✅ Yes
At least one digit	✅ Yes
At least one special character	✅ Yes

🛠️ Technologies Used
Python 3

Tkinter for the GUI

re (regex) module for pattern matching

📌 Use Cases
Ideal for beginners learning Python GUI development

Helpful tool for educating users on secure password practices

Can be integrated into larger password management systems

